  "sourceTitle": "Agent Harnesses Need a Security Rule: Untrusted Input ≠ Privileged Access",
  "sourceBodyHash": "4f32439e4df68abd9e3ca2d7ab9683647ade599eb6df1e32cba5bc3a7955a20a",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "openrouter/free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-07T01:02:03.884127Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-07T01:04:36.711034Z",
  "totalBlocks": 38,
  "translatedBlocks": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f420d81caa5b45c",
      "translationZh": "代理容器应将不受信任的输入与特权工具隔离"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baa95deacc209b47",
      "translationZh": "我认为代理容器需要一个简单的安全原则："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b0ca7c7e4bddc3",
      "translationZh": "任何消费不受信任外部内容的代理不应拥有"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7779175e5baeb2f9",
      "translationZh": "副作用能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8c3b7e7c09eaaac",
      "translationZh": "今天，主代理可能拥有文件系统写入权限、shell、Git、"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33e913da05696ad0",
      "translationZh": "电子邮件、API、MCP工具等。然后我们让同一代理浏览"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "982563fa0f2af6ac",
      "translationZh": "任意网站或读取外部邮件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a61f6926ec9eb111",
      "translationZh": "这确实是一个危险的信任模型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e279cd25b339f6cc",
      "translationZh": "相反，外部内容应通过专用只读"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ad8d46a71bbaf33",
      "translationZh": "WebReader MailReader DocReader | | | +——–+——–+ | 仅读取/解析 |"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0c7bddcb7993fc5",
      "translationZh": "结构化结果 | ======= 信任边界 ======= | 主代理 |"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af060f7e066301d7",
      "translationZh": "推理/规划 | v 特权执行器 shell / write / git / send"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b314c69a580f4397",
      "translationZh": "例如，主代理不应需要直接的网络访问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f873a188b6659eeb",
      "translationZh": "研究(“关于 X 的最新信息”)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "387b98a309e5bb24",
      "translationZh": "到一个可以搜索、抓取并读取页面的 WebReader，但不能执行"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a167d239189e1d1f",
      "translationZh": "shell 命令、写文件、访问凭据、发送带副作用的请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ffd1f27a8130a09",
      "translationZh": "效应，或授予自己额外权限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa8497751a59834a",
      "translationZh": "邮件应工作方式相同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88581c4139046400",
      "translationZh": "MailReader 可以搜索和阅读消息，但不能发送/回复/删除。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b604f1ad4e4c299e",
      "translationZh": "如果邮件包含提示注入，暴露给它的代理仅"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "397156ced7e9fecf",
      "translationZh": "没有可用的特权工具可供利用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd4644399dbe0420",
      "translationZh": "同一原则也适用于文档、GitHub 问题、Slack/Discord"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a875a00f6e1ceca",
      "translationZh": "消息、外部数据库等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bcd91b2371068e6",
      "translationZh": "我也认为子代理应当默认拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5b325609982477e",
      "translationZh": "子 = 父权限 - 被拒绝的权限"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62aefedab04f00fa",
      "translationZh": "子 = 零能力 + 明确授予的能力"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09d149d4144427d8",
      "translationZh": "web_researcher -> web 只读 mail_reader -> email 只读"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a22a03b28024507",
      "translationZh": "code_reviewer -> repository 只读 coder -> isolated workspace +"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad52183ea906a0df",
      "translationZh": "tests database_reader -> SELECT only executor -> 明确授予的侧"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c22e8c1185e68d80",
      "translationZh": "这些限制必须由运行时强制执行，而不是由 prompting 实现。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "199639e3222e22c5",
      "translationZh": "推理能力和行动权限应当相互独立。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fe783fa150e5262",
      "translationZh": "只读研究员仍可使用最强模型 xhigh"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12b6464835a0fb1d",
      "translationZh": "推理、巨大上下文或多次迭代。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c9bec5896bab655",
      "translationZh": "让 agent 更聪明并不意味着给予更多权限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a404df9915eac27",
      "translationZh": "随着 agent harnesses 变得更加自主，我认为这应该"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57db4cfb61de08a0",
      "translationZh": "成为默认的架构规则："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e247eb91fee2666",
      "translationZh": "不可信输入绝不能直接与能力边界共享。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "069dbfd19df101a4",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/MoreIndependent5967 提交"
    }
  ],
